 'thresholds':rows,
 'minimum_pairwise_threshold_separation_k1_to5':sep,
 'theorem':'For the full strict active-gain quadratic expansion V_g=D(p||u)-(g/2) f^T A f near uniform, the radial Hessian on doublet k is (q-g lambda_k) I_2. The five strict doublet eigenvalues lambda_1,...,lambda_5 are distinct, so no single scalar g makes more than one distinct spectral doublet critical at once.',
